            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A unique and dark, linear story-driven adventure.<br></li><li> Challenging puzzles.<br></li><li> Four separate short episodes, each about 20 minutes long and with distinct cases about dark world of human trafficking in the city of New Orleans.<br></li><li> It always rains.</li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Rainyday is a gritty and atmospheric, top-down, old school detective adventure about human trafficking inspired by Sierra's classics and 1990s masterpieces like Dreamweb, Harvester, Bloodnet etc.<br><br>Take the role of John Rainy. An ageing, tired and depressed NOPD detective investigating strange child disappearances in the city of New Orleans. <br><br>Jump in and descent into the dark, grim world of Rainyday, where superstitious beliefs prevail and the evil of man knows no limits.<br><br>Purchasing this product will grant access to ALL four episodes.<br><br>Episode Release Dates:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue Episode *RELEASED*</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Episode 1: Gris-gris *RELEASED*</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Episode 2: Kids *RELEASED*</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Episode 3: From the Abyss *RELEASED*</h2>",
